       "exact_text": "help(kind=\"search_incomplete\") not accepted yet (review 1). The robot's own search_scope(\"sponge\") lists 1 region(s) not cleared: drawer_unit:0 (reasons in SCENE STATE). Search them if the preconditions allow, or stop now with a help of another kind, which stands; another review needs a new observation."
